  "description_html": "A reconstruction of the SMG seen in <a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/artwork/A38bX\" class=\"SelectedElement\" target=\"_blank\">one of the pre-alpha promotional posters</a>, that was seemingly modelled after it's real-life counterpart, the Walther MPL. Made with fidelity to the game's aesthetics, including the sounds, just to simulate what it would look like if valve decided to roll with it rather than the model we're used to.<br><br>Done (a little late) as requested by <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/blogs/19512\">https://gamebanana.com/blogs/19512</a>. Modelled, textured,animated in Blender by myself.",
